{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05763","headline":"赠广川马先生 · 卢象","name":"赠广川马先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经书满腹中，吾识广川翁。\n年老甘无位，家贫懒发蒙。\n人归洙泗学，歌盛舞雩风。\n愿接诸生礼，三年事马融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}